<title>USA: Birmingham Steel, Mitsui complete venture.</title>
<headline>Birmingham Steel, Mitsui complete venture.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Birmingham Steel Corp said on Tuesday it and an affiliate of Mitsui &amp; Co Ltd completed the formation of a previously announced joint venture in southern California to collect, process and sell scrap.</p>
<p>Birmingham Steel and the Mitsui affiliate each own a 50 percent interest in the Pacific Coast Recycling LLC venture, the company said.</p>
</text>
